==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|grammar}} The [[case]] used to indicate movement '''out of''' something; for example, ''out of the house''. Some languages that make use of the elative are [[Finnish]], [[Hungarian]], and [[Estonian]].

